WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.420
Get ready to learn English with a Disney
Pixar classic: Up.

00:00:14.799 --> 00:00:18.560
But quickly before we get into today's
lesson, I want to let you know that,

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:21.600
if you're new here, every week we make
new lessons like this one,

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:25.840
