00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:36.520
Hey, let me just interrupt the lesson
really quick to ask you a question.

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:39.919
So, do you ever feel lost when you listen
to natives?

00:05:39.919 --> 00:05:42.960
We don't pronounce everything like
you're expecting?

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:48.160
You miss words and it seems like in real
life we just speak so fast sometimes, right?

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:51.280
Well, how would you
like to be able to understand natives

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:56.160
confidently no matter how fast we speak?
Well we have a three-part Master Class

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:58.720
to teach you the Three Keys to being
able to understand

00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:02.080
natives at any speed,
and you can sign up for FREE,

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:05.120
by clicking up here or down the
description below. We look forward to

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:07.120
